      "summary_en": "K'Sante knocks an enemy back, launching them through any wall in their path. Then, K'Sante goes All Out and dashes after them, gaining increased damage, healing, and transformed abilities at the cost of reduced defenses.",
      "summary_zh": "奎桑提将一个敌人击退，并带其翻越沿途的任何墙体。然后，奎桑提进入【全盛姿态】并冲刺至其身后，获得提升过的伤害、治疗效果、以及转化过的各个技能，但代价是各防御属性降低。",
